# Ledger Shredder, played for real. "A player" is any player: Bot1 controls the Shredder, and on turn 4 Bot2 casts two
# Pyrite Spellbombs. Bot2's second spell makes Bot1's Shredder connive (Bot1 draws, discards a nonland card, and the
# Shredder grows), while Bot2's hand and library are untouched by it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Ledger Shredder
Island
Pyrite Spellbomb
Island
Island
Island
Pyrite Spellbomb
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Island
Island
Pyrite Spellbomb
Pyrite Spellbomb
Island
Island
Island
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ledger Shredder.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Pyrite Spellbomb.Cast
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ledger Shredder.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
Bot2.Battlefield.Island#2.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Pyrite Spellbomb.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Pyrite Spellbomb)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Ledger Shredder.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot2.Hand.Count = 5
Stack.Count = 0
